WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.669
"This snow is deep," said Poppy.

2
00:00:14.670 --> 00:00:17.861
"I can't drive in it!"

3
00:00:17.862 --> 00:00:21.629
"I can't drive either," said Dipper.

4
00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:36.496
"I'm stuck!"

5
00:00:36.497 --> 00:00:40.592
Jeb drove through the snow.

6
00:00:40.593 --> 00:00:48.635
"I can drive in it," he said.

7
00:00:48.636 --> 00:00:52.880
Wind blew.

8
00:00:52.881 --> 00:00:59.223
It made big snow piles.

9
00:00:59.224 --> 00:01:04.000
The snow piles blocked the road.

10
00:01:04.001 --> 00:01:07.625
"Uh-oh," said Jeb.

11
00:01:07.626 --> 00:01:10.588
"We can't get to the road."

12
00:01:10.589 --> 00:01:16.835
"We're stuck at school!" said Eddy.

13
00:01:16.836 --> 00:01:21.884
Mr. Grill went into the garage.

14
00:01:21.885 --> 00:01:29.593
He came out with a snowplow.

15
00:01:29.594 --> 00:01:43.742
His snowplow pushed the snow.

16
00:01:43.743 --> 00:01:47.312
Soon the parking lot was clear.

17
00:01:47.313 --> 00:01:56.084
"We can move now!" said Poppy.

18
00:01:56.085 --> 00:02:01.363
Mr. Grill pushed the snow piles.

19
00:02:01.364 --> 00:02:05.258
But the piles were too big.

20
00:02:05.259 --> 00:02:08.351
Snap!

21
00:02:08.352 --> 00:02:12.126
"Ugh!" said Mr. Grill.

22
00:02:12.127 --> 00:02:16.471
"My snowplow broke!"

